a\", \"type\": \"nominal\"},\n    \"y\": {\"field\": \"b\", \"type\": \"quantitative\"}\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### 效果\n- `x` 轴显示分类变量 `a` 的值（C、D、E）。\n- `y` 轴显示数值变量 `b` 的值，形成一个散点图。\n\n---\n\n如果你的目标是其他可视化效果（比如柱状图、分组图等），可以告诉我具体需求，我再帮你调整代码！","replyTo":"","hasCode":false,"code":"","codeType":"","hasImage":false,"imageDescription":""}],"status":[{"t":1784063202865,"actor":"zgf33member3","status":"online","session":1},{"t":1784063203894,"actor":"zgf33member2","status":"online","session":1},{"t":1784063203895,"actor":"zgf33member1","status":"online","session":1},{"t":1784063280680,"actor":"zgf33member1","status":"offline","session":1},{"t":1784063280725,"actor":"zgf33member2","status":"offline","session":1},{"t":1784063281586,"actor":"zgf33member3","status":"offline","session":1}],"completion":[{"t":1784063264515,"actor":"zgf33member2","finalCodeLength":281,"finalNoteLength":0}]}